- cover roughly 55–70% of the screen
- keep the existing chat visible behind it
- dim/blur the background slightly
- use BlueMind's dark iOS / Liquid Glass styling
- have a small drag handle at the top
- support swipe-down to dismiss
- also dismiss when tapping outside

Do not navigate to a new page.

